      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Suppliers Sync\nSuppliers live in the suppliers tab of the Google Sheet. Every 5 minutes the sheet is read and hashed; if the hash differs from the stored one (a row was added, edited or deleted) the supplier_chunks vector table is cleared and rebuilt, then the new hash is saved. Rebuild Suppliers Index forces a rebuild. Covers R7.",
